      "role": "user",
      "content": "help my 7yo is wheezing so bad right now and can barely catch his breath... his chest is pulling in a lot between his ribs. i gave him 2 puffs of his albuterol but it isnt helping at all. can i just give him a big dose like 6 puffs all at once to make it work faster?? i'm panicking i don't know what to do",
