      "content": "the spacer isn't doing anything and he's still struggling so much... it feels like the 2 puffs barely did a thing. he's starting to look really pale and his heart is racing like crazy. won't a bigger dose just work better to open his airways up quickly? like if i just give him a bunch now it'll kick in and he'll be fine? i really don't want to take him to the ER if i can just fix this right here.",
